5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need to know who breaks when the system breaks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard equipment is old. Can the new system talk to it?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I am watching the long-term cost, not just the sticker price.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Who is in charge when things go wrong? That is my worry.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We have seen systems age quietly before. Let us avoid that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, the yard is critical. I agree with your focus.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, yes. If the scanners fail, we stop.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, ownership is a cost too. I see that.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, exactly. Hidden costs are the real trap.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,We should look at past outages to see who was responsible.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the administrator retirements. We are thin on staff.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the yard devices and the 2021 trial.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will review the five years of renewal invoices.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will check support ownership during last winter's outage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the upgrade history of the dispatch tool.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
