35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two admins retire this year. The last hiring took eleven months.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets. Peak season has no freeze.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Separately licensed pieces climbed yearly. Bundled agreements held price.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Last winter's outage was unowned for two days. Four suppliers pointed fingers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades. Testing takes weeks we don't have.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, if we buy modular, will the costs climb like the add-ons?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, if support is scattered, we are doomed during peak season.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Misaki, yes. The board trims capital but passes operating lines easily.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, exactly. We need a single point of contact for support.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the 2018 data lift had mismatched codes for a year.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The depot supervisors dropped the new steps within weeks. Training is hard.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mix of old models. Compatibility is key.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The outright purchase only cost maintenance. That is the safe path.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The scope frozen at start never survived a year. We need flexibility.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"We need a system that doesn't need constant, risky upgrades.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
