60,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"Candidates are A, B, C, and D. Let us discuss.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Kenji,,D is on our servers. That might help with the yard devices.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Toshio,,A is modular. That sounds like the expensive add-ons I saw.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Yumi,,B has a regional service team. That solves the ownership issue.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,C uses a partner for migration. That reminds me of the 2018 mess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Yumi, B's fixed configuration might be too rigid for our changes.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, A's independent licensing is risky. I prefer D's stability.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, C's partner model is dangerous. I avoid it.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Misaki, B's team is local. That is better than scattered support.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, D's on-premise nature means we own the upgrades.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Misaki,,D has an engineering team present. That helps with the admin gap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Kenji,,D is built for transport. It should handle our calendar better.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Toshio,,D is an outright purchase. Only maintenance costs after. That is best.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Yumi,,D's team is present. That ensures someone is in charge.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,D avoids the quiet aging of hosted systems. I agree.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote for D.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I vote for D.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
